{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "停链与回滚",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 111.08,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "链也可能整条停下。",
   "spoken": "链也可能整条停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.448,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "活性，是链能继续处理新交易。",
   "spoken": "活性，是链能继续楚理新交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.268,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 4.366,
   "speechEnd": 7.151
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "安全性，是已经确认的结果不被推翻。",
   "spoken": "安全性，是已经确认的结果不被推翻。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.208,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 8.306,
   "speechEnd": 11.377
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "2021 年 9 月，一次代币发行引来机器人交易洪泛。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 9 月，一次代币发行引来机器人交易洪泛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 12.436,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 12.534,
   "speechEnd": 16.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "Solana 验证者内存溢出，全网停止出块约 17 小时。",
   "spoken": "Solana 验证者内存溢出，全网停止出块约 17 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.504,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 17.602,
   "speechEnd": 21.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "2022 年 10 月，BSC 上的跨链桥被伪造证明攻击。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 10 月，BSC 上的跨链桥被伪造证明攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 22.716,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 22.814,
   "speechEnd": 26.516
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "BNB Chain 要求验证者暂停出块，新版本冻结了攻击者地址。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain 要求验证者暂停出块，新版本冻结了攻击者地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.568,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 27.666,
   "speechEnd": 32.392
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "验证者少的链，可以在几小时内协调停链、冻结，甚至回滚。",
   "spoken": "验证者少的链，可以在几小时内协条停链、冻结，甚至回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.452,
   "dur": 6.288,
   "speechStart": 33.55,
   "speechEnd": 38.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "这能救急，也说明这条链的不可篡改，是有前提的。",
   "spoken": "这能救急，也说明这条链的不可篡改，是有前提的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.96,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 40.058,
   "speechEnd": 44.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "L2 的排序器，通常由一个运营方负责出块。",
   "spoken": "L2 的排序器，通常由一个运营方负责出块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.316,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 45.414,
   "speechEnd": 48.64
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "它刚出的 unsafe 头，只是排序器的承诺，可以被回滚。",
   "spoken": "它刚出的 unsafe 头，只是排序器的承诺，可以被回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.688,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 49.786,
   "speechEnd": 53.655
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 升级后停链，并两次回滚。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 升级后停链，并两次回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 54.708,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 54.806,
   "speechEnd": 58.948
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "第二次回滚掉约 20 分钟的交易。",
   "spoken": "第二次回滚掉约 20 分钟的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 60.016,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 60.114,
   "speechEnd": 62.268
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "如果交易所按 unsafe 头入账，用户随即提走，块又被回滚。",
   "spoken": "如果交易所按 unsafe 头入账，用户随即提走，块又被回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 63.332,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 63.43,
   "speechEnd": 67.822
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "这笔损失，由交易所承担。",
   "spoken": "这笔损失，由交易所承担。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 68.88,
   "dur": 3.072,
   "speechStart": 68.978,
   "speechEnd": 71.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "所以大额要等 L1 上最终确定的批次。",
   "spoken": "所以大额要等 L1 上最终确定的批次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.172,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 72.27,
   "speechEnd": 75.722
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "排序器宕机时，用户可以通过 L1 合约，强制提交交易。",
   "spoken": "排序器宕机时，用户可以通过 L1 合约，强制提交交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 76.784,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 76.882,
   "speechEnd": 81.37
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "最后一种资源，是别人的动机。",
   "spoken": "最后一种资源，是别人的动机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 82.428,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 82.526,
   "speechEnd": 84.918
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "2020 年 3 月的 Steem 事件，报道称 Huobi、Binance 和 Poloniex，用托管的客户 STEEM 投票。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 3 月的 Steem 事件，报道称 Huobi、Binance 和 Poloniex，用托管的客户 STEEM 投票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 85.984,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 86.082,
   "speechEnd": 93.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "帮助 Justin Sun 控制了见证人席位，Huobi 承认动用了客户资金。",
   "spoken": "帮助 Justin Sun 控制了见证人席位，Huobi 承认动用了客户资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 94.316,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 94.414,
   "speechEnd": 99.604
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "交易所的托管资产，本身就是共识权力。",
   "spoken": "交易所的托管资产，本身就是共识权力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 100.656,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 100.754,
   "speechEnd": 103.932
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "客户资产默认不参与投票，例外要有书面授权。",
   "spoken": "客户资产默认不参与投票，例外要有书面授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-21.mp3",
   "start": 105.004,
   "dur": 4.872,
